{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "0c6a79a2-daf6-8abb-b57a-b46622a24f63",
  "created_at": "2026-01-30T11:30:33-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Kevin Flynn",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Priya Raman",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T11:28:51-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Priya. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T11:28:55-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, Kevin Flynn. I'm calling for my mother about her water and sewer bill. You're on speaker, I've got the bill in one hand and my coffee in the other."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T11:29:05-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. What's the service address on the bill?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T11:29:09-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "422 Bellevue Avenue. Or, wait. [pause] No, that's the other one. I've got two properties, hers and the rental, and I've got the bills mixed up on the table."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T11:29:19-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Take your time. Which one is your mother's?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T11:29:22-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hers is 422 Bellevue. The rental bill is the one that jumped, and I was reading the wrong one to you. Sorry. I'm running on about four hours of sleep. We've got a new baby in the family, my granddaughter's, and everybody's up all night."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T11:29:36-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Congratulations. So the 422 Bellevue bill is the one you want to ask about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T11:29:41-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, 422. Mom's. It's higher than usual and she's on a fixed income. Is there any discount for low-income or elderly households?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T11:29:48-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can look at the account and see what's driving the increase. As for a senior or income-based discount, I don't have that program in front of me. I'll find out from the billing supervisor and make a note on the account."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T11:30:01-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. Can you put all that in writing? What you find, and what the discount answer is. I don't want to be calling back and starting over."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T11:30:10-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I can send a written explanation. Is the mailing address the same as 422 Bellevue?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T11:30:16-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Same. Mom's house. Not the rental. Make sure it goes on her account."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T11:30:21-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, her account only. And a callback number, in case I have questions?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T11:30:26-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0167."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T11:30:27-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Mr. Flynn. You'll get it in the mail."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T11:30:31-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thanks."
    }
  ],
